# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in. After editing, restart Metro with
# `npm start -- --reset-cache`, and re-run `pod install` (iOS) / rebuild (Android)
# so the native Google Maps SDKs pick the key up too.
#
# One key serves the Maps SDK (Android + iOS) and the Places API (New).
# Restrict it in Google Cloud Console (Android package + SHA-1 / iOS bundle ID,
# and limit APIs to: Maps SDK for Android, Maps SDK for iOS, Places API (New)).
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
